<title>USA: Family Golf Centers Q4 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Family Golf Centers Q4 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended  For the Year Ended</p>
<p>			12/31/96    12/31/95   12/31/96    12/31/95</p>
